\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} In ℕ, k * j = 1 forces k = 1 (and by symmetry, j = 1).}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Proved by explicit case analysis on k; omega only closes the final}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} numeric contradiction. NB: the calc chain is written in the ≤}
